  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> Your opponent grabs two of your fingers in each hand and violently tears the two pairs in different directions, ripping your hand in half lengthwise, splitting it almost to the wrist! Although the metacarpals and tendons are intact, your hand now looks like a grotesque lobster claw.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (2). The hand is useless for the rest of the encounter (see under Amputated Parts), but will count as a Torn Muscle (Major) after the encounter when you’ve had a chance to wrap the two halves of the split hand together again with a bandage or rag.</p>"
    },
